      ],
      "title": "迈向明日之歌·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "37517001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "绿洲，收容区域——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37517002",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "水鹤——连舞！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37517003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "呜，数量太多了，快被包围了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37517004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "是最坏的情况了……守卫拦不住分身了，她们在不断地从各个地方涌过来……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37517005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "……请你们停止这样的暴行。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37517006",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "咣——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37517007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "呵……他们已经得到了「惩罚」。还要继续硬撑吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37517008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "我能感受到你们的愤怒……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37517009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "为什么？请告诉我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37517010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "我们……看到了一切。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37517011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "一起走吧，我们会慢慢地告诉你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37517012",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "别听她的！她们只是想绑走本体而已！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37517013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "我也不会让你们把朋友带走……「英雄」是不能临阵脱逃的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604001",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "叮铃铃——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "什么声音……啊，是小乔给的对讲机……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604004",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "通讯接通。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604005",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "不是……小乔吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "啊，我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604007",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "肯定是她信任的人吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604008",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "你身边的那位就是天使？「AP」找到了，该怎么帮助你们？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "挡住了！……我会给大家争取时间！虽然没什么自信……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "百合，请告诉她怎么做。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "喂，你知道自己在说什么吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "想好了吗？这次的我们数量不比「之前」少，一瞬间「同化」这么多分身的意识……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "你的人格不可能平安无事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "她们本来就是我的一部分……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "我想理解她们的愤怒，还有……悲伤。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "小奏……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "真是一直都这么固执呢。好吧，我会协助的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604019",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "首先，是它的登录密码……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "「LIFEISBEAUTIFUL」……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "是来到这个世界后新设置的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37604022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "「活着就是美好的事情」……曾经有人这么教会了我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-923",
