      ],
      "title": "迈向明日之歌·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "37518001",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……程序修改好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "好……和之前一样，等小奏发动「和声」，数秒后那些分身就会被吸收。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "「和声」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "开始倒计时了呢……嗯？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "对不起……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "把手……松开。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "我会全部接受的。你们的情绪和记忆……本来就是我珍贵的宝物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "是……吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518010",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "唔……！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518011",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "小奏！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518012",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518013",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518014",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "你知道这里是哪吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "看上去像是垃圾场。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518017",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "我正处在……她们的记忆里。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "这个答案……50分吧。再仔细看看，这可不是普通的垃圾场，而是「真相」本身。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "那些白色的东西是……手办？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "没错，这些在露天的垃圾堆里埋着的，身上沾满脏污的……就是手办，或者说曾是手办的东西。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "为了确保失去「商品」的价值，身体的零件都拆得七零八落了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518022",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "怎么会这样……？",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "……为什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "历史上，曾经发生过因为牛奶生产过剩，奶农就把牛奶倒掉来稳定物价的事吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "手办也是差不多的东西，卖不出去了自然也需要批量销毁。这样才能节省仓储成本，继续保留作为商品的稀缺性啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "寻找善待自己的主人？和人类愉快地生活？说什么蠢话，这里的倒霉蛋可连商品都做不成了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518028",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "……这也太残酷了。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "在这个世界，人类就是不讲理的神，手办则是仍由其支配的玩物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "稍感欣慰的是，绝大部分的手办是没有活化的，它们什么都感觉不到。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "但是……嘘。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518032",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "……！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "其实你已经听见了吧……只是不愿相信……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518034",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "啊……啊……为什么……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518035",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "为什么我还有感觉……请让我死吧……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518036",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "……我诅咒你们……永远不会原谅……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518037",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "一切都毫无意义……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "听到他们的悲鸣了吧？真是顽强啊，即使到这种程度也还没白模化。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518039",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "好难过……「心脏」的地方在疼……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518040",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "……是谁干的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518041",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "天使，原来也是会愤怒的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518042",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "这里是FULI旗下的经销商之一曾使用的废弃物填埋地。但真正的凶手……呵呵呵……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518043",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "顺带一提，还有些手办因为别的原因躺在了这里。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518044",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "他们……是「绿洲」的第一批住民。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518045",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518046",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "我现在明白了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37518047",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "……我和你们约好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-924",
