      "title": "迈向明日之歌·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "37519001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "看起来，危机成功解除了呢？真是可喜可贺。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "但是……有机可乘！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "波雷亚斯",
          "text": "唔唔……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "这条龙刚才一直紧张得发抖诶，果然只有外表才像样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519005",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "居然从波波的爪子那钻过去了？",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519006",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "帕拉斯！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519007",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>警告：本机动力不足30%，即将退出长距离巡航模式。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519008",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "咻——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "好险好险，翅膀差点就被射穿了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "波波，带我追她！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "波雷亚斯",
          "text": "什么时候……！脚底有陷阱，吾被缠住了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "希塔——期待和你的下一次见面！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "希望到时候，你能给我一个满意的……答案。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "塞拉……总有一天……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519015",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "一段时间后，绿洲——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "怎么办……这么久了她还没醒过来……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "是我的错，明明知道这会对她的意识造成巨大的负担……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "不，谁都没有错。应该做的是想办法唤醒她。逗猫棒会管用吗……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "这怎么想也不会管用吧……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "而且也不能保证醒过来的会是同化的众多意识中的哪一个……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "……嗯……啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "……！啊，醒过来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519023",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "喂，小奏！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "呵呵呵呵……是我苏醒了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519025",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "咦？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519026",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "这个语气……？糟糕，醒过来的是冷酷的天使的人格！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "噗……百合，是我啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "我是和你一起来到这个世界的奏哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "吓死我了，你感觉还好吗?有没有哪里不舒服？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "百合真是越来越会关心人了。也谢谢你，真乃。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "嗯，醒过来就是最好的。你真的不要紧吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "我没事，所有的一切都记得，包括分身们的事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "……太好了呢，小奏。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "唔，抱得太紧了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "我看到了分身们的记忆，她们迫切地想为手办们做什么，但采取了过激的方式。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "……和死后世界的大家一样，手办们的人生也有着各种遗憾。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "接下来……还有很多想做的事情。你能继续帮我吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37519038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "那当然了，我们早就是同伴了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-925",
